Description: Native System, Software, Cleanup and Developer Environment Manager
 Linux Manager is a modern desktop management and cleanup suite designed
 specifically for Ubuntu, Debian, and Debian-based distributions. It consolidates
 system updates, APT and Flatpak package management, cache and developer artifact
 cleanup (Node, Python, Java, Rust, Android, Docker), systemd service controls,
 hardware telemetry, and storage analysis behind a safe, unprivileged GUI.
